try Queue

queue Pool [order: Fee]
ask Name, Fee [into: Pool]

item a [Fee: 3]
item b [Fee: 8]

step Highest first
  say A queue line places a queue. Chips line up from the highest value of the field in order.
  line Pool: a, b

step Cut in
  say A sent chip also takes its place by the value of that field.
  ask c, 5
